Patch File for DeHackEd v3.0

#
# French dehacked patch.
#
# This is a set of string replacements to convert the normal English
# strings to those used in the French version of doom2.exe.
# These strings are found in the Doom source code as d_englsh.h and
# d_french.h.
#
#
# The following is a magic comment to allow long string replacements
# in Chocolate Doom:
#
# *allow-long-strings*
#

Text 20 20
Gamma correction OFFCORRECTION GAMMA OFF

